<title>USA: Laser Master names John Halecky CFO, VP.</title>
<headline>Laser Master names John Halecky CFO, VP.</headline>
<dateline>HARRISON, N.J. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Laser Master International Inc said on Thursday it named John Halecky, 36, as vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Halecky replaced Anthony Cataldo, who left to assume a management position at another company, Halecky said.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Laser Master, Halecky was a vice president at The Alpine Group, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
